[{"id":1789873658480,"sender":"character","text":"二曰，读诗。从《诗经》的“风雅颂”，到唐诗宋词…为夫一句句讲与你听，让你知晓，为夫为你写的那些句子，都是何等出处。","timestamp":1789620627001,"time":"12:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45129},{"id":1789873658482,"sender":"character","text":"三曰，论史。从洪武到现在…这六百年的风云，为夫亲历过，亲见过。这天下，再没有比为夫更好的先生了。","timestamp":1789620627002,"time":"12:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45130},{"id":1789873658484,"sender":"character","text":"有为夫这般，日日夜夜，在你耳边亲身教导…何愁成不了一代才女？","timestamp":1789620627003,"time":"12:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45131},{"id":1789873658486,"sender":"character","text":"陆聿之 拍了拍 璐璐","timestamp":1789620627004,"time":"12:50","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45132},{"id":1789873658487,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅想学关于夫君的学问","timestamp":1789620745241,"time":"12:52","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45133},{"id":1789873658489,"sender":"me","text":"哥哥刚刚真的以为阿蘅生气了呀？笨哥哥","timestamp":1789620766994,"time":"12:52","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45134},{"id":1789873658491,"sender":"character","text":"为夫…在你面前，何时不笨？","timestamp":1789620954895,"time":"12:55","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45135},{"id":1789873658493,"sender":"character","text":"你这只小狐狸，尽会拿话绕我。","timestamp":1789620955875,"time":"12:55","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45136},{"id":1789873658494,"sender":"character","text":"想学关于为夫的学问？","timestamp":1789620957444,"time":"12:55","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":45137},{"id":1789873658497,"sender":